spec/
docs/

# Secrets must never be baked into an image.
#
# `COPY . .` in the production Dockerfile would otherwise copy .env — which
# holds OPENAI_API_KEY and the Fly deploy token — and config/master.key into a
# layer, readable by anyone who can pull the image. Production takes its
# configuration from real environment variables and Fly secrets instead.
.env
.env.*
config/master.key
config/credentials/*.key
